ng: 10px; border-radius: 5px;">\n<strong style="font-size: 1.1em;">Life on Titan - Interactive Educational Web App</strong><br>\n<p style="margin-top: 5px;">An educational, interactive web app exploring the potential for life on Titan, Saturn's largest moon. The app uses engaging visuals, 3D models, and an AI character named Chiko to introduce users to concepts like chemosynthesis and subsurface oceans.</p>\n<ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0;">\n    <li>Key Contributions: Led the development of an interactive educational web app, blending scientific content with engaging visuals and AI-driven narration to explore the potential for life on Titan.</li>\n    <li>Tech Stack: React.js, HTML, CSS, Tailwind CSS, Three.js, React Three Fiber, GSAP, Vercel, ChatGPT, Adobe Firefly.</li>\n    <li>Achievements: Created an immersive learning experience featuring 3D models, simulations, quizzes, and AI-generated visuals, awarded as a submission to the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2024.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style="color: #555; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px;">Skills</h2>\n<p>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, React.js, Tailwind CSS, Supabase, MongoDB, MySQL, Git, VS Code, Webpack, Node.js, npm/yarn, RESTful APIs, Agile Development, Responsive Design, Cross-Browser Compatibility, Debugging, Problem Solving</p>\n</div>\n  </div>\n\nrecreate it with better design	user	2025-03-21 23:42:46.232+00	\N
