 frameworks and machine learning. Features real-time face processing, secure biometric authentication, and an advanced face analysis suite.</p> <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0;"> <li>Key Contributions: Led the development of a cutting-edge facial recognition system, integrating machine learning models for real-time face detection, emotion analysis, and gender detection.</li> <li>Tech Stack: JavaScript, Node.js, Express, TensorFlow.js, Face-API.js.</li> <li>Achievements: Implemented a secure biometric authentication system with anti-spoofing measures, achieving high accuracy in multi-face recognition and real-time processing, integrated batch processing of ZIP archives.</li> </ul> </div> <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;"> <strong style="font-size: 1.1em;">Plant Guardian - Smart Plant Monitoring App</strong><br> <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Plant Guardian is a smart app designed to help plant enthusiasts maintain healthy plants by monitoring soil moisture levels. The app sends real-time push notifications, alerting users when their plants need watering, ensuring optimal care and plant health.</p> <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0;"> <li>Key Contributions: Developed a complete solution integrating hardware and software for real-time plant monitoring, including designing the user interface, backend API, and microcontroller integration.</li> <li>Tech Stack: React.js, Node.js, Express.js, Firebase Cloud Messaging, Tailwind CSS, Arduino.</li> <li>Achievements: Created an app that provides real-time soil monitoring and custom alerts, fostering optimal plant health and a user-friendly experience for plant enthusiasts, hardware integration with microcontrollers</li> </ul> </div> <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;"> <strong style="font-size: 1.1em;">Life on Titan - Interactive Educational Web App</strong><br> <p style="margin-top: 5px;">An educational, interactive web app exploring the potential for life on Titan, Saturn's largest moon. The app uses engaging visuals, 3D models, and an AI character named Chiko to introduce users to concepts like chemosynthesis and subsurface oceans.</p> <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0;"> <li>Key Contributions: Led the development of an interactive educational web app, blending scientific content with engaging visuals and AI-driven narration to explore the potential for life on Titan.</li> <li>Tech Stack: React.js, HTML, CSS, Tailwind CSS, Three.js, React Three Fiber, GSAP, Vercel, ChatGPT, Adobe Firefly.</li> <li>Achievements: Created an immersive learning experience featuring 3D models, simulations, quizzes, and AI-generated visuals, awarded as a submission to the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2024.</li> </ul> </div> <h2 style="color: #555; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px;">Skills</h2> <p>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, React.js, Tailwind CSS, Supabase, MongoDB, MySQL, Git, VS Code, Webpack, Node.js, npm/yarn, RESTful APIs, Agile Development, Responsive Design, Cross-Browser Compatibility, Debugging, Problem Solving</p> </div> </div> recreate it with better design	user	2025-03-21 23:43:18.814+00	\N
