ed content.\n\nCreated interactive 3D models using Three.js.\nTech Stack: React, Three.js, GSAP\nEnhanced learning experience with AI-driven narration and simulations.\nSKILLS\nAgile, ATS, CSS, Data Structures, Git, Firebase, GSAP, HTML, JavaScript, MongoDB, React, REST, Tailwind, TensorFlow, Three.js, TypeScript, Webpack, Node.js	user	2025-03-25 11:32:47.817+00	\N
