 engineering team.\\n  </p>\\n\\n  \\n  <h2 style=\\"font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 15px;\\">Work Experience</h2>\\n  <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 18px;\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;\\">Software Engineer</strong> | Tech Solutions Inc. | San Francisco, CA<br>\\n    <em style=\\"font-size: 14px; color: #777;\\">July 2019 – Present</em>\\n    <ul style=\\"margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0; list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px;\\">\\n      <li>Developed and maintained key features for a SaaS platform using React, Node.js, and PostgreSQL, improving user engagement by 15%.</li>\\n      <li>Led the design and implementation of a new microservice for payment processing, increasing transaction throughput by 25%.</li>\\n      <li>Mentored junior engineers, providing code reviews and technical guidance, fostering team growth.</li>\\n      <li>Collaborated with product managers and designers in an Agile environment to define and implement product requirements.</li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 18px;\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;\\">Junior Software Developer</strong> | Web Innovators LLC | Austin, TX<br>\\n    <em style=\\"font-size: 14px; color: #777;\\">June 2017 – July 2019</em>\\n    <ul style=\\"margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0; list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px;\\">\\n      <li>Assisted in developing front-end components using Angular and TypeScript for client websites.</li>\\n      <li>Optimized database queries, reducing average API response time by 20%.</li>\\n      <li>Participated in code deployments and managed bug tracking using JIRA.</li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  \\n  <h2 style=\\"font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px;\\">Education</h2>\\n  <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 18px;\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;\\">Bachelor of Science in Computer Science</strong><br>\\n    University of Texas at Austin | Austin, TX<br>\\n    <em style=\\"font-size: 14px; color: #777;\\">Graduated: May 2017</em><br>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">GPA: 3.7/4.0</span>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  \\n  <h2 style=\\"font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px;\\">Technical Skills</h2>\\n  <p style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n    <strong>Languages:</strong> JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, Python, Java, SQL<br>\\n    <strong>Frameworks/Libraries:</strong> React, Node.js, Express, Angular, Spring Boot<br>\\n    <strong>Databases:</strong> PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis<br>\\n    <strong>Cloud/DevOps:</strong> AWS (EC2, S3, Lambda), Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, Git, CI/CD<br>\\n    <strong>Methodologies:</strong> Agile, Scrum, RESTful APIs, Microservices\\n  </p>\\n\\n  \\n  <h2 style=\\"font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 15px;\\">Projects</h2>\\n  <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 12px; border-left: 3px solid #3498db; background-color: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 4px;\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;\\">Real-Time Collaborative Editor</strong>\\n    <p style=\\"font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 5px;\\">Developed a web-based document editor allowing multiple users to collaborate simultaneously using WebSockets, React, and Node.js.</p>\\n    <em style=\\"font-size: 13px; color: #777;\\">Tech Stack: React, Node.js, Socket.IO, MongoDB</em>\\n  </div>\\n\\n</div>", "personalInfo": {"data": null, "collected": false}}	inactive	<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 25px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 10px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); color: #333; line-height: 1.6;">\n\n  \n  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; paddin