g 2020</em>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 5px; color: #666;\\">StartupX, San Francisco, CA</div>\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 5px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>Built real-time analytics dashboard using React and TypeScript with 95% test coverage</li>\\n                <li>Optimized database queries reducing API response time by 25% using PostgreSQL and Redis</li>\\n                <li>Collaborated on Agile team using Jira and Git following CI/CD best practices</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    \\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 25px;\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\"font-size: 20px; color: #1a0dab; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a0dab; padding-bottom: 5px;\\">EDUCATION</h2>\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 15px;\\">\\n            <div style=\\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\\">\\n                <strong>BS in Computer Science</strong>\\n                <em>Aug 2017 - May 2021</em>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>Stanford University, Stanford, CA</div>\\n            <div>GPA: 3.8/4.0 | Relevant Coursework: Algorithms, Distributed Systems, ML</div>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    \\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 25px;\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\"font-size: 20px; color: #1a0dab; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a0dab; padding-bottom: 5px;\\">TECHNICAL SKILLS</h2>\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 15px;\\">\\n            <strong>Languages:</strong> Python, Java, Go, JavaScript, SQL, C++<br>\\n            <strong>Frameworks:</strong> React, Node.js, Spring Boot, TensorFlow<br>\\n            <strong>Tools:</strong> Git, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, Jenkins, PostgreSQL<br>\\n            <strong>Concepts:</strong> Distributed Systems, Data Structures, OOP, REST APIs\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    \\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 25px;\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\"font-size: 20px; color: #1a0dab; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a0dab; padding-bottom: 5px;\\">PROJEC