vice for payment processing, increasing transaction throughput by 25%.</li>\n      <li>Mentored junior engineers, providing code reviews and technical guidance, fostering team growth.</li>\n      <li>Collaborated with product managers and designers in an Agile environment to define and implement product requirements.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div style="margin-bottom: 18px;">\n    <strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;">Junior Software Developer</strong> | Web Innovators LLC | Austin, TX<br>\n    <em style="font-size: 14px; color: #777;">June 2017 – July 2019</em>\n    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0; list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px;">\n      <li>Assisted in developing front-end components using Angular and TypeScript for client websites.</li>\n      <li>Optimized database queries, reducing average API response time by 20%.</li>\n      <li>Participated in code deployments and managed bug tracking using JIRA.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  \n  <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Education</h2>\n  <div style="margin-bottom: 18px;">\n    <strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;">Bachelor of Science in Computer Science</strong><br>\n    University of Texas at Austin | Austin, TX<br>\n    <em style="font-size: 14px; color: #777;">Graduated: May 2017</em><br>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">GPA: 3.7/4.0</span>\n  </div>\n\n  \n  <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Technical Skills</h2>\n  <p style="font-size: 14px;">\n    <strong>Languages:</strong> JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, Python, Java, SQL<br>\n    <strong>Frameworks/Libraries:</strong> React, Node.js, Express, Angular, Spring Boot<br>\n    <strong>Databases:</strong> PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis<br>\n    <strong>Cloud/DevOps:</strong> AWS (EC2, S3, Lambda), Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, Git, CI/CD<br>\n    <str