ter Science &amp; Engineering (CSE)</strong><br>\\n        Mymensingh Engineering College, Mymensingh, Bangladesh<br>\\n        Expected Graduation: 2026<br>\\n        GPA: 3.51/4.0<br>\\n        Relevant Coursework: Data Structures and Algorithms, Database Management Systems, Object-Oriented Programming, Web Development, Software Engineering\\n    </p>\\n\\n    <h2 style=\\"color: #555; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px;\\">Projects</h2>\\n\\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\\">\\n        <strong style=\\"font-size: 1.1em;\\">ResumeGuru - AI-Powered Resume Builder</strong><br>\\n        <p style=\\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 0.9em;\\">AI-driven resume builder with modern design and ATS optimization.</p>\\n        <ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0; font-size: 0.9em;\\">\\n            <li>Led front-end and back-end development.</li>\\n            <li>Tech: React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Supabase.</li>\\n            <li>Engineered a secure, user-friendly platform.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    \\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\\">\\n        <strong style=\\"font-size: 1.1em;\\">UPP Campus - Modern Campus Social Platform</strong><br>\\n        <p style=\\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 0.9em;\\">React-based social platform for university students.</p>\\n        <ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0; font-size: 0.9em;\\">\\n            <li>Spearheaded platform development and UX.</li>\\n            <li>Tech: React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Supabase.</li>\\n            <li>Developed key social features and real-time updates.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\\">\\n        <strong style=\\"font-size: 1.1em;\\">FaceFusion - Advanced Facial Recognition System</strong><br>\\n        <p style=\\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 0.9em;\\">Web app with facial recognition using JavaScript and ML.</p>\\n        <ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0; font-size: 0.9em;\\">\\n            <li>Led the development and ML integration.</li>\\n            <li>Tech: JavaScript, Node.js, TensorFlow.js.</li>\\n            <li>Implemented secure biometric authentication.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\\">\\n        <strong style=\\"font-size: 1.1em;\\">Plant Guardian - Smart Plant Monitoring App</strong><br>\\n        <p style=\\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 0.9em;\\">Smart app for plant health monitoring.</p>\\n        <ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0; font-size: 0.9em;\\">\\n            <li>Developed hardware and software integration.</li>\\n            <li>Tech: React.js, Node.js, Firebase, Arduino.</li>\\n            <li>Created real-time monitoring and custom alerts.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;\\">\\n        <strong style=\\"font-size: 1.1em;\\">Life on Titan - Interactive Educational Web App</strong><br>\\n        <p style=\\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 0.9em;\\">Educational web app exploring potential life on Titan.</p>\\n        <ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0; font-size: 0.9em;\\">\\n            <li>Led development and AI integration.</li>\\n            <li>Tech: React.js, Three.js, ChatGPT, Adobe Firefly.</li>\\n            <li>Created immersive learning experience.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <h2 style=\\"color: #555; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px;\\">Skills</h2>\\n    <p>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, React.js, Tailwind CSS, Supabase, MongoDB, MySQL, Git, VS Code, Webpack, Node.js, npm/yarn, RESTful APIs, Agile Development, Responsive Design, Cross-Browser Compatibility, Debugging, Problem Solving</p>\\n\\n</div>", "personalInfo": {"data": {"name": "C.M. Mahim Masrafi", "email": "mahimmasrafi04@gmail.com", "phone": "01912244011", "location": "Mymensingh Engineering College Hall, Mymensingh, Bangladesh"}, "collected": true}}	inactive	<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 20px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px;">\n    <h1 style="color: #333; text-align: center;">C.M. Mahim Masrafi</h1>\n    <p style="text-align: center;">Mymensingh Engineering College Hall, Mymensingh, Bangladesh | 01912244011 | mahimmasrafi04@gmail.com</p>\n\n    <h2 style="color: #555; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px;">Summary/Objective</h2>\n    <p>A versatile and skilled Computer Science student with a strong foundation in full-stack development and a keen interest in AI applications. Experienced in building modern web applications using React, Node.js, and Supabase, with a passion for developing innovative AI-driven solutions. Seeking opportunities to leverage technical expertise and contribute to a dynamic, forward-thinking team focused on cutting-edge AI projects.</p>\n\n    <h2 style="color: #555; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px;">Education</h2>\n    <p>\n        <strong>Bachelor of Science in Computer Science &amp; Engineering (CSE)</strong><br>\n        Mymensingh Engineering College, Mymensingh, Bangladesh<br>\n        Expected Graduation: 2026<br>\n        GPA: 3.51/4.0<br>\n        Relevant Coursework: Data Structures and Algorithms, Database Management Systems, Object-Oriented Programming, Web Development, Software Engineering\n    </p>\n\n    <h2 style="color: #555; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px;">Projects</h2>\n\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;">\n        <strong style="font-size: 1.1em;">ResumeGuru - AI-Powe