iversity club focused on the rising VLSI industry in Bangladesh.</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 10px;\\">\\n            <strong>Founder</strong>, oneAPI Community Group Bangladesh\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 3px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>Dedicated to bringing together enthusiasts and professionals passionate about oneAPI technology.</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 10px;\\">\\n            <strong>Ranked 3rd - Industrial Training</strong>, Ulkasemi Pvt. Limited <em>10/12/2024 – 27/12/2024</em>\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 3px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>Completed training on Analog Design, IC Mask Design &amp; IC Physical Design.</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    \\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 15px;\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\"font-size: 16px; color: #1a0dab; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a0dab; padding-bottom: 3px;\\">PROJECTS</h2>\\n\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 10px;\\">\\n            <strong>Recon Solar Shield Initiative - RSSI</strong> <em>13/08/2023 – 08/11/2023</em>\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 3px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>Web platform for predicting magnetic reconnection using AI.</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 10px;\\">\\n            <strong>PC Health Monitoring and Early Warning System</strong> <em>21/06/2023 – 11/07/2023</em>\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 3px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>PC maintenance and environmental monitoring system.</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 10px;\\">\\n            <strong>Transmission of IoT Data Over Long Range with LORA</strong> <em>09/03/2023 – 11/05/2023</em>\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 3px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>IoT data communication over long distance.</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 10px;\\">\\n            <strong>Minimalistic Design of Lower Numerical Width ALU</strong> <em>14/04/2022 – 29/05/2022</em>\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 3px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>Designed ALU with minimal instruction set.</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    \\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 15px;\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\"font-size: 16px; color: #1a0dab; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a0dab; padding-bottom: 3px;\\">CERTIFICATIONS</h2>\\n        <ul>\\n            <li>RISC-V Processor - RV32I Base ISA - Maven Silicon</li>\\n            <li>Python Essentials 2 - Coding in Python 3 - Cisco Networking Academy</li>\\n            <li>8086, 80386 and P5 Microarchitecture - Bharat Acharya Education</li>\\n        </ul>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    \\n    <div style=\\"margin-bottom: 15px;\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\"font-size: 16px; color: #1a0dab; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a0dab; padding-bottom: 3px;\\">VOLUNTEERING</h2>\\n\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 10px;\\">\\n            <strong>Intel ® Student Ambassador for oneAPI</strong> <em>14/02/2024 – Current</em>\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 3px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>Promote and support Intel technology specifically oneAPI.</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 10px;\\">\\n            <strong>Microsoft Learn Student Ambassador</strong> <em>24/01/2024 – Current</em>\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 3px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>Contributed to the MLSA program.</li>\\n            </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\"margin-top: 10px;\\">\\n            <strong>Ulkasemi Campus Ambassador for MEC</strong> <em>28/02/2025 – Current</em>\\n            <ul style=\\"margin: 3px 0; padding-left: 20px;\\">\\n                <li>Representing Ulkasemi on campus.</li>\\n            </ul