718a306f-fe6b-4c92-9e8b-11ac69ca062a	45437649-c00c-4ebc-a9db-64cf06558a7a	2025-04-02 06:09:24.892+00	Resume April 2nd, 2025	HTML/PDF	<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 12px; background-color: #fafafa; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); color: #333; line-height: 1.6;">\n    \n    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">\n        <h1 style="margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 32px; color: #222;">C.M. Mahim Masrafi</h1>\n        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #555;">Full Stack Developer | Vibe Coding | CSE Undergrad at MEC<br>\n            Dhaka, Dhaka, Bangladesh<br>\n            <a href="tel:01912244011" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">01912244011</a> |\n            <a href="mailto:mahimmasrafi111@gmail.com" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">mahimmasrafi111@gmail.com</a> |\n            <a href="www.linkedin.com/in/c-m-mahimmasrafi-84b623223" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">LinkedIn</a>\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: #0066cc; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;">Summary</h2>\n    <p>\n        Full stack developer with enriched knowledge of AI integration and a strong foundation in mobile app development. Experienced in React Native and proficient in building cross-platform applications. Seeking to leverage expertise to optimize application performance, enhance UI/UX, and contribute to innovative projects at Daniyal Technologies.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: #0066cc; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;">Top Skills</h2>\n    <p>\n        React Native, Flutter (Good to have), Mobile App Architecture (MVVM, Clean Architecture), RESTful API Integration, Database Management (RDBMS, NoSQL), Performance Optimization, Debugging, NextJs, NestJs\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: #0066cc; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;">Experience</h2>\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">\n        <strong>Co-Founder</strong>, Flan BD<br>\n        January 2025 - Present (4 months)<br>\n        Mymensingh Sadar Upazila, Bangladesh<br>\n        <p>Online gift shop based in Mymensingh.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: #0066cc; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;">Projects</h2>\n    \n    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #0066cc; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px;">\n        <strong style="font-size: 18px;">ResumeGuru - AI-Powered Resume Builder</strong>\n        <p>A modern resume builder leveraging AI to transform the career journey. Built with React and TypeScript, featuring professional templates and ATS-optimized content.</p>\n        <ul style="margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0;">\n            <li>Led development of front-end and back-end integration.</li>\n            <li>Tech Stack: React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Supabase, React Query, Framer Motion</li>\n            <li>Built a secure and user-friendly platform with real-time and multi-format export.</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #0066cc; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px;">\n        <strong style="font-size: 18px;">UPP Campus - Modern Campus Social Platform</strong>\n        <p>A social platform for university students to connect and share updates. Includes real-time updates and secure authentication.</p>\n        <ul style="margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0;">\n            <li>Developed a seamless user experience with responsive design.</li>\n            <li>Tech Stack: React, TypeScript, Supabase, Framer Motion</li>\n            <li>Created a feature-rich platform with real-time notifications and user profiles.</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #0066cc; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px;">\n        <strong style="font-size: 18px;">FaceFusion - Advanced Facial Recognition System</strong>\n        <p>A sophisticated web app using machine learning for real-time facial recognition and emotion analysis.</p>\n        <ul style="margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0;">\n            <li>Integrated TensorFlow.js for real-time face detection and emotion analysis.</li>\n            <li>Tech Stack: Node.js, TensorFlow.js, Face-API.js</li>\n            <li>Engineered secure biometric authentication with anti-spoofing measures.</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #0066cc; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px;">\n        <strong style="font-size: 18px;">Life on Titan - Interactive Educational Web App</strong>\n        <p>An educational app exploring the potential for life on Titan, with engaging visuals and AI-generated content.</p>\n        <ul style="margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0;">\n            <li>Created interactive 3D models using Three.js.</li>\n            <li>Tech Stack: React, Three.js, GSAP</li>\n            <li>Enhanced learning experience with AI-driven narration and simulations.</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: #0066cc; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;">Education</h2>\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">\n        <strong>Bachelor of Science in Computer Science and Engineering</strong>, Mymensingh Engineering College<br>\n        November 2021 - November 2026\n    </div>\n\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">\n        <strong>HSC, Science</strong>, RAJUK Uttara Model College<br>\n        July 2019 - January 2021\n    </div>\n</div>
4d1d36fd-a184-4b73-a6f6-79413c07e526	45437649-c00c-4ebc-a9db-64cf06558a7a	2025-04-05 06:53:16.923+00	Resume April 5th, 2025	HTML/PDF	<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 25px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 10px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); color: #333; line-height: 1.6;">\n\n  \n  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 15px;">\n    <h1 style="margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 28px; color: #2c3e50;">Alex Chen</h1>\n    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #555; margin: 5px 0;">\n      San Francisco, CA | \n      <a style="color: #3498db; text-decoration: none;" href="tel:123-456-7890">123-456-7890</a> | \n      <a style="color: #3498db; text-decoration: none;" href="mailto:alex.chen@email.com">alex.chen@email.com</a> | \n      <a style="color: #3498db; text-decoration: none;" href="https://linkedin.com/in/alexchen-dev">linkedin.com/in/alexchen-dev</a> | \n      <a style="color: #3498db; text-decoration: none;" href="https://github.com/alexchen">github.com/alexchen</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  \n  <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Summary</h2>\n  <p style="font-size: 14px;">\n    Innovative and results-oriented Software Engineer with 5+ years of experience in full-stack development, specializing in building scalable web applications and optimizing backend systems. Proven ability to lead projects, collaborate effectively in Agile teams, and deliver high-quality code. Seeking to leverage expertise in cloud technologies and microservices architecture to contribute to a dynamic engineering team.\n  </p>\n\n  \n  <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Work Experience</h2>\n  <div style="margin-bottom: 18px;">\n    <strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;">Software Engineer</strong> | Tech Solutions Inc. | San Francisco, CA<br>\n    <em style="font-size: 14px; color: #777;">July 2019 – Present</em>\n    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0; list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px;">\n      <li>Developed and maintained key features for a SaaS platform using React, Node.js, and PostgreSQL, improving user engagement by 15%.</li>\n      <li>Led the design and implementation of a new microservice for payment processing, increasing transaction throughput by 25%.</li>\n      <li>Mentored junior engineers, providing code reviews and technical guidance, fostering team growth.</li>\n      <li>Collaborated with product managers and designers in an Agile environment to define and implement product requirements.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div style="margin-bottom: 18px;">\n    <strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;">Junior Software Developer</strong> | Web Innovators LLC | Austin, TX<br>\n    <em style="font-size: 14px; color: #777;">June 2017 – July 2019</em>\n    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0; list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px;">\n      <li>Assisted in developing front-end components using Angular and TypeScript for client websites.</li>\n      <li>Optimized database queries, reducing average API response time by 20%.</li>\n      <li>Participated in code deployments and managed bug tracking using JIRA.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  \n  <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Education</h2>\n  <div style="margin-bottom: 18px;">\n    <strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;">Bachelor of Science in Computer Science</strong><br>\n    University of Texas at Austin | Austin, TX<br>\n    <em style="font-size: 14px; color: #777;">Graduated: May 2017</em><br>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">GPA: 3.7/4.0</span>\n  </div>\n\n  \n  <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Technical Skills</h2>\n  <p style="font-size: 14px;">\n    <strong>Languages:</strong> JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, Python, Java, SQL<br>\n    <strong>Frameworks/Libraries:</strong> React, Node.js, Express, Angular, Spring Boot<br>\n    <strong>Databases:</strong> PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis<br>\n    <strong>Cloud/DevOps:</strong> AWS (EC2, S3, Lambda), Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, Git, CI/CD<br>\n    <strong>Methodologies:</strong> Agile, Scrum, RESTful APIs, Microservices\n  </p>\n\n  \n  <h2 style="font-size: 20px; color: #3498db; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Projects</h2>\n  <div style="margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 12px; border-left: 3px solid #3498db; background-color: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 4px;">\n    <strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50;">Real-Time Collaborative Editor</strong>\n    <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 5px;">Developed a web-based document editor allowing multiple users to collaborate simultaneously using WebSockets, React, and Node.js.</p>\n    <em style="font-size: 13px; color: #777;">Tech Stack: React, Node.js, Socket.IO, MongoDB</em>\n  </div>\n\n</div>
